      *################################################################*00010000
      *                                                                 00020000
      * FD International Services                                       00030000
      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R116IBI0.                                             00050001
      *                                                                 00060000
      * Interface for all database access on table VA_BIC.              00070001
      *                                                                 00080000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00090000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified.               00100004
      *                                                                 00120000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180000
      *                                                                 00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary call may look like this:                            00210000
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R116IBI0-BIC             00230001
      *    Set   R116IBI0-Version        To    True                     00240001
      *    Set   R116IBI0-In-Select      To    True                     00250001
      *                                                                 00251002
      *    Move  &Bic-Bank               To    R116IBI0-In-Bank         00252002
      *    Move  &Bic-Country            To    R116IBI0-In-Country      00253002
      *    Move  &Bic-Location           To    R116IBI0-In-Location     00254002
      *    Move  &Bic-Location           To    R116IBI0-In-Location     00254113
      *                                                                 00254213
      *                                                                 00256002
      *    Call  'F116IBI0'              Using R116IBI0-BIC             00330001
      *                                        R7919999-Error           00340000
      *    End-Call                                                     00350000
      *                                                                 00360000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00370000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Abend                                  00380000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        00390000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00400000
      *                                                                 00410000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Feil                                   00420000
      *        ...not found...                                          00430000
      *                                                                 00440000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-OK                                     00450000
      *        ...found...                                              00460000
      *                                                                 00470000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00480000
      *                                                                 00490000
      *################################################################*00500000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00510000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00520000
      *040101!NDL! New copy area                                 !LT12! 00530000
      *################################################################*00540000
      *                                                                 00550000
         03  R116IBI0-BIC.                                              00560001
      *                                                                 00570000
           05  R116IBI0-Version-No              Pic  X(08).             00580001
             88  R116IBI0-Version                    Value '20010104'.  00590001
      *                                                                 00600000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00610000
      *                                                                 00620000
           05  R116IBI0-Qualification.                                  00630001
      *                                                                 00640000
             10  R116IBI0-In-Action             Pic  X(16).             00650001
               88  R116IBI0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00660001
               88  R116IBI0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00670001
               88  R116IBI0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00680001
               88  R116IBI0-In-Update                Value 'UPDATE'.    00690001
               88  R116IBI0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00700001
               88  R116IBI0-In-Select                Value 'SELECT'.    00830001
      *                                                                 00850000
      * There are several key-fields, which may be used differently     00860000
      * depending on the need.                                          00870000
      *                                                                 00880000
      * For Insert, use the Data area for all fields.                   00891002
      *                                                                 00892002
      * For Select, Update and Delete, use:                             00893002
      *     - Bic-Bank                                                  00900002
      *     - Bic-Country                                               00910002
      *     - Bic-Location                                              00920002
      *     - Bic-Branch                                                00930002
      *                                                                 00970000
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), use:                           00980000
      *     - Optional: Bic-Bank  (e.g. 'HAND')                         00990009
      *     - Optional: Bic-Country    (e.g. 'NO')                      01000009
      *     - Optional: Bic-Location with mask                          01010002
      *     - Optional: Bic-Branch   with mask                          01020002
      *                                                                 01030000
             10  R116IBI0-In-Key.                                       01040001
               15  R116IBI0-In-Bic-Code.                                01041012
                 20  R116IBI0-In-Bank           pic X(4).               01050002
                 20  R116IBI0-In-Country        pic X(2).               01060002
                 20  R116IBI0-In-Location       pic X(2).               01061002
                 20  R116IBI0-In-Branch         pic X(3).               01062002
      *                                                                 01070000
      * When performing a Get-1st-call one may ask for the total        01140000
      * number of rows complying with the qualification.                01150000
      *                                                                 01160000
             10  R116IBI0-In-Code-Count         Pic  X(10).             01170001
               88  R116IBI0-In-CC-Count              Value 'COUNT'.     01180001
      *                                                                 01190000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01200000
      *                                                                 01210000
           05  R116IBI0-Data.                                           01220001
      *                                                                 01230000
