      *                                                                 01460303
      * The following accumulators are only relevant when performing    01461003
      * Get-1st or Get-Next.                                            01470000
      * Row-No starts on 1 when doing Get-1st, and increases by 1 for   01480000
      * each Get-Next.                                                  01490000
      * Total-Rows is set when doing Get-1st, but ONLY if the           01500000
      * In-CC-Count is set. The field will tell you how many rows       01510000
      * that complies with your qualification.                          01520000
      *                                                                 01530000
             10  R116IBI0-Out-Accumulators.                             01540001
               15  R116IBI0-Out-Row-No          Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01550001
               15  R116IBI0-Out-Total-Rows      Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01560001
